in on devhelmmail.com. 2 Point your test at it. Sign up with signup-${Date.now()}@your-domain in staging. 3 Add the wait. Paste the snippet above. The first matched wait returns the email and the code. Example $ export DEVHELM_API_TOKEN=dh_live_xxxxxxxx
$ export DEVHELM_WORKSPACE_ID=1234
$ export DEVHELM_MAIL_DOMAIN=acme-qa.devhelmmail.com
$ npx playwright test signup.spec.ts
